Package: fancontroller
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Fizgrad <Fizgrad@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-cairo, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec
Homepage: https://github.com/Fizgrad/XiaoXinAir14-2020-ARE-Tools
Description: XiaoXin Control Center for Lenovo laptop hardware on Linux
 Native GTK application for hardware monitoring, battery information and
 kernel-supported Lenovo laptop settings. Runs on Wayland and X11.
 Hardware changes use a restricted, administrator-authenticated helper;
 the graphical application runs as the normal desktop user.
